		<RichText x="66" y="666" width="506" height="174" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="16" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">当生命值<span color="#ffdfbf">低于50%</span><span>时，雪精会尝试将自己封入冰棺，冰棺为</span><span color="#99ffff">20冻</span><span>盾，</span><span color="#ffdfbf">16s</span><span>后解除并恢复</span><span color="#ffdfbf">20%生命值</span><span>，若击破冰棺则使其</span><span color="#ffdfbf">失去等量生命值</span><span>，同时虚弱</span><span color="#ffdfbf">10s</span><span>。受</span><span color="#bfdfff">「星烁反应」</span><span>影响，冰棺会使</span><span color="#ffacff">雷</span><span>/</span><span color="#7fffd7">风</span><span>的相应反应消耗比变为</span><span color="#ffdfbf">1:4</span><span>。<br/></span><span color="#bfffbf">(N4) </span><span>冰棺厚度翻倍，为</span><span color="#99ffff">40冻</span><span>盾。<br/></span><span color="#ffbfbf">(N5) </span><span>冰棺厚度提升，为</span><span color="#99ffff">42冻</span><span>盾，且改为在</span><span color="#ffdfbf">80%生命值</span><span>左右开盾，16s后解除并恢复</span><span color="#ffdfbf">10%生命值</span><span>，若击破冰棺则使其</span><span color="#ffdfbf">失去等量生命值</span><span>。冰棺在受到</span><span color="#bfdfff">「星烁反应」</span><span>影响后，将转为「冰明屏障」。冰棺至多开启2次，第二次冰棺将在破盾约</span><span color="#ffdfbf">35s</span><span>后展开。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
